<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【方程】</span> 解方程：<span class="f"><span class="n">2x</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = 0.8，<i>x</i> = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
