<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【方程】</span> 解方程：<i>x</i> + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = 0.75，<i>x</i> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 挑戰層（共 6 題，🚀 選做 — 分數小數 1 題＋方程 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
