<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️1</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【方程】</span> 解方程：<span class="f"><span class="n">x</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">x</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">x</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">11</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>，求 <i>x</i>。（含三個分數項的方程）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️2</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【分數小數】</span> 甲有 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 公斤糖果，乙的糖果是甲的 0.5 倍，丙的糖果比甲多 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 公斤。三人共有糖果多少公斤？（分數作答，三個步驟）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️3</td><td><span style="color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;">【方程】</span> 水箱原有水 <i>L</i> 升。放出 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 後，再加入 2.5 升，現在有 8 升水。設原有水為 <i>L</i> 升，列方程求解。（提示：放走 <span class="fi"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 即是剩下 <span class="fi"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
</table>
